data: {"v":{"message":{"id":"4e444f26-c673-41e9-b9e9-aa75bda2bd41","author":{"role":"tool","name":"web.run","metadata":{"real_author":"tool:web.run"}},"create_time":1793644903.28221,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[""]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"search_result_groups":[{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.theverge.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1023173/jackery-explorer-100d-portable-power-station-battery-lithium-iron-phosphate","title":"Jackery made its portable power stations even smaller","snippet":"Jackery\u2019s new Explorer 100D is its smallest portable power station, measuring 4.6 by 3.4 by 3.4 inches and weighing 1.87 pounds. Its 96Wh (30,000mAh) capacity is designed to fit in carry-on luggage and power devices while traveling. The unit uses lithium iron phosphate (LFP) batteries, which Jackery says are engineered for up to eight years of regular use and 3,000 charge cycles\u2014longer-lasting than typical lithium-ion cells. It has two 140W USB-C ports and one 18W USB-A port, with total output capped at 158W when multiple ports are used. It also supports up to 100W of solar input, reaching 80 percent charge in about 90 minutes. The Explorer 100D goes on sale at Walmart on November 15 for $99; it is already available at Costco in a two-pack for $179.99. An integrated handle is included, and an optional shoulder strap is available.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":9},"pub_date":1793595600.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/3ivbEzaIMx4WF5OhanX3Woso2kVSIxw-yc1cssGE5ozfG2GsA8uqonuZ3PwGvpaafvTGEq8Uwmmyz4_MyUxWYCVcaRBd3EtS1DCjtystwjAaQffEOGfJvMz1zse7ddwslXvJ3eS6PlBHapx6HcDSIz3Z1DraO3OZxpi28GC-epZR-8u7ZCi5XOA_bJbFiF5PHrGJzN_I-eEbn1OBGI6T3kH8SpA70OTJjAgH8c5UeKY","attribution":"www.theverge.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.techradar.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techradar.com/pro/this-ecoflow-delta-3-classic-bundle-is-the-home-backup-battery-id-keep-ready-for-winter-storms-and-its-usd119-off-at-best-buy","title":"This EcoFlow Delta 3 Classic bundle is the home backup battery I'd keep ready for winter storms, and it's $119 off at Best Buy","snippet":"EcoFlow\u2019s Delta 3 Classic bundle is on sale at Best Buy for $479, down $119 (20%) from its $598 list price. The 26.7-pound power station has a 1,024Wh lithium iron phosphate battery rated for 3,000 charge cycles, 1,800W continuous AC output (3,600W peak), and a five-year warranty. It can provide quiet, fume-free backup for essentials such as a refrigerator, router, space heater, or CPAP machine, and is also suited to camping and RV use. The bundle includes a protective bag and a 45W solar panel. However, the panel is too small for rapid recharging and would need more than a full day of ideal sunlight to refill the battery, so it is best treated as a top-up option. The article recommends the deal for dependable outage backup, while noting that the model itself has not been tested; the recommendation draws on EcoFlow\u2019s track record and tests of other products. Buyers should also consider its weight and that it is sold and shipped by a Best Buy marketplace seller.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":10},"pub_date":1793388756.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/KWkWz0pRGulOzSz30sD7vjOd-biDV-1NejwojYjvrSiujvn1QYn0NK4r0eD37w5loKjYaHv8N5hcjgnda41WAll2WXtjTqIoCaMvpBqDeaVI9FsJSOC5xyIjgqpl3O1V","attribution":"www.techradar.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techradar.com/best/portable-power-stations","title":"Best portable power stations: Reliable off-grid power & backup","snippet":"The EcoFlow Delta 3 Plus takes our top spot for most users, blending generous capacity and rapid recharge times with a wide selection of ports. \u00b7 \u00b7","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8},"pub_date":1657644279.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/NHjvoePjtEhiMNGF_wHQzeNP6yrSjlToqQMmTL0MNrdYYa2lQD2HvXXU1BZ2O6ph7FRFqe5EeXV3QheYEYFF_ZQZroDDI-3YJ9iFwhmy4GrXZZAzMacqhEHMwnoCngQB","attribution":"www.techradar.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.sfgate.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.sfgate.com/shopping/article/comfortable-car-camping-setup-22463018.php","title":"How to build a seriously comfortable car camping setup","snippet":"The article explains how to create a comfortable car-camping setup by prioritizing shelter, good sleep, easy meals, lighting, cooling, seating, and cleanup without overpacking. Because gear travels by car, campers can choose roomy tents, thick sleeping pads, full-size bedding, sturdy cookware, and larger comfort items, while still considering campsite dimensions and vehicle cargo space. It compares recommended products across categories, including family tents and compatible footprints; insulated or compact sleeping pads, sleeping bags, pillows, and blankets; two-burner stoves, cookware, grills, and coolers; lanterns and portable power stations; chairs, ground blankets, fans, hydration gear, and storage organizers. The guide also emphasizes practical selection: match sleeping-bag warmth to forecast conditions, check stove fuel and device power needs, size coolers to planned meals, and verify gear compatibility. Safety advice includes keeping first-aid supplies accessible, checking weather alerts, carrying suitable vehicle tools, and following campground fire rules. Overall, the best setup depends on trip length, group size, weather, available cargo and campsite space, and which comforts will make the biggest difference.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":11},"pub_date":1793212210.0,"attribution":"www.sfgate.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.sfgate.com/shopping/article/sungale-portable-power-station-solar-panel-deal-20331289.php","title":"Get a 320W portable power station and solar panel for just $310","snippet":"The Sungale 320W Portable Power Station and Solar Panel Bundle is available for $309.99, discounted 23% from its $399.99 regular price. Designed for emergencies, travel, and off-grid use, the power station can charge up to eight devices simultaneously through three DC ports, two AC outlets, and three USB ports, including USB-C and quick-charging options. Its 93,120mAh/298Wh battery uses a pure sine wave inverter for stable power and includes an LED flashlight and digital battery display. The unit can be recharged through a wall outlet, car charger, or the included waterproof folding solar panel. The panel converts approximately 21%\u201323% of sunlight into usable energy, can charge devices directly, and includes 10 connector plugs for broad compatibility. The compact, lightweight design makes the bundle convenient for outdoor activities and emergency preparedness. The promotional price is subject to change and availability.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":15},"pub_date":1747762211.0,"attribution":"www.sfgate.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.digitalcameraworld.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.digitalcameraworld.com/buying-guides/best-laptop-power-bank","title":"The best portable power banks and power stations in 2026: stay topped up, on the go, or in the event of a power outage","snippet":"This guide recommends four portable power options for keeping laptops and other devices charged while traveling, working off-grid, or during outages. The DJI Power 1000 is a 1,024Wh, 2,200W power station aimed especially at drone users, with fast USB-C and DJI-specific charging ports, though it lacks app features and is relatively heavy. The UGREEN 300W 48,000mAh is the best overall laptop power bank, charging up to five devices and offering high capacity, but weighs 1.86kg and does not include a charging plug. For fast charging, the UGREEN 145W provides 25,000mAh and a 100W USB-C port in a 505g package, though its power-output options can be confusing. The Anker Prime 20,000mAh offers up to 200W total output and a particularly useful display showing charge levels and time remaining. The guide advises choosing at least 20,000mAh for laptop use and checking that the bank\u2019s ports and cables match the laptop.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":12},"pub_date":1793118795.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/AGX8l43xoy-69LY4WVGAantB4WcJVCU3k3jdvLiTmRmdSoAyHdGNKBI7KFJ0RG18DNTwWpje7F8EihYh9RjD2qacsoNnwlt81EBFOoxHZo2UyG5DJganoS61s6tnAih4","attribution":"www.digitalcameraworld.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"nymag.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nymag.com/strategist/article/best-emergency-kit-items.html?utm_campaign=feed-part&utm_medium=social_acct&utm_source=rss","title":"The Best Items to Stock for Any Emergency, According to Survivalists","snippet":"The article compiles emergency-preparedness advice from government agencies and 22 survivalists, preppers, and emergency professionals. Its central message is to prepare for peace of mind, keep supplies practical and manageable, and understand personal limits rather than overloading a go-bag. Core recommendations include a backpack or other portable storage; flashlight or headlamp; multi-tool; customized first-aid kit and a month of essential medicines; hand-crank radio; fire-starting tools; rechargeable batteries and power bank; warm bedding; hygiene and cleaning supplies; and familiar, nonperishable food. Store at least one gallon of water per person per day for seven days, plus containers and ways to purify more. Additional gear may include masks, gloves, goggles, emergency blankets, whistle, tarp, duct tape, paracord, cooking equipment, and a tent. Experts stress having a written, practiced household plan, keeping supplies accessible, testing equipment, and protecting important documents. The article also suggests optional items such as a generator, fuel, solar chargers, maps, and Faraday bags. Choose supplies suited to likely hazards, household needs, and the ability to carry or use them.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":13},"pub_date":1793193780.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/9u0iDux4dq7bRHzwqJC6mqkybSJTM-8lui525dcoKP6q4I0NemCGz_YwjZAyKKlaL9XiE7P87iCZ0w3wpQoV4n67548yDG_z7ZkcxiAzp9XahJlcySZFsCotworde8zC7UGRT_4F_elFRBDnz7jWq5MOKsOZwdyAqKIe8VlLDXQ","attribution":"nymag.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nymag.com/strategist/article/best-emergency-preparedness-items-for-first-time-homeowners.html?utm_campaign=feed-part&utm_medium=social_acct&utm_source=rss","title":"The Emergency-Preparedness Items I'm Buying As a First-Time Homeowner","snippet":"This guide helps first-time homeowners prepare for fires, floods, storms, power outages, evacuations, and other emergencies. Experts recommend maintaining both a portable go bag and a two-week stay-at-home supply kit containing one gallon of water per person per day, nonperishable food, lighting, a radio, first-aid supplies, medications, sanitation items, important documents, and cash. Suggested household equipment includes fire extinguishers and fire blankets, water-leak sensors, a wet/dry vacuum, flood barriers, emergency radios, portable chargers or power stations, lanterns, headlamps, and a properly ventilated generator with carbon-monoxide protection. Evacuation kits should also include N95 masks, prescription medicines, customizable first-aid supplies, and pet necessities such as food, water, leashes, carriers, bowls, and identification photos. For more severe disruptions, the article recommends trauma kits, portable toilets, camping stoves, and water filters or purifiers. Rechargeable devices should carry certification from an OSHA-recognized Nationally Recognized Testing Laboratory because of lithium-ion battery risks. Homeowners should also enable Wireless Emergency Alerts on their phones.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":18},"pub_date":1787856692.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/OQXGn0u2_ILSCBO5SJiaBj5I5NsKGNsEHY1HDN9fZz_7zWjZbdB78YqmrP13SLY4J9urw5Akjki4Ttlrc6a_rokaq9jNWedf92wITz1rpLDtcxUVcrsTNLHA8dd5U6fLwgDm6E5GGD2alNEIvxCDNncAQyVzA0Z0UMB4Nrv3ZVYMn1sT-ZDfkCSiSasTELou","attribution":"nymag.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"backuppowerhub.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://backuppowerhub.com/best-budget-power-stations-under-500/","title":"Best Power Stations Under $500: 7 Budget Picks (2026)","snippet":"How We Tested & Ranked These Budget Power Stations \u00b7 #1 \u2013 Anker SOLIX C300X \u2013 Best Overall Value Under $500 \u00b7 #2 \u2013 Bluetti Elite 30 V2 \u2013 Best for\u00a0...","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":0},"pub_date":1763045578.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/w7r5kKVXK26GrP6_e8BN_Otabl0MQNyOCBL1njxIMpxrVLvPxncaB7nC3ajSg8fohiM31NexXBbV7d_XfEvnciU8jC4xbbF6IR4oiBFgltUZG5EMLM6mYgEIIDjPg7LQEsqVZiWnrmUxIJjT6ZNBeFmwyCKTZLWzVMnGPpQH1-s","attribution":"backuppowerhub.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.outdoorgearlab.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.outdoorgearlab.com/topics/camping-and-hiking/best-power-station","title":"The Best Power Stations of 2026 - Outdoor Gear Lab","snippet":"The Jackery 2000 v2 is the best power station. The best value power station for most people is the Anker C1000 Gen 2. Affordably priced \u2014 currently on sale for\u00a0...","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":1},"pub_date":null,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/RWIPRoEkbDyQs84YKNWDze_ztUEz48PCaQganaRcx2lba0qrJgquXq0R6MX7mUDMLDXW3jis8BfOUA8qxEtvBBh21iqEVrh2guEhEZf9QOqkoOS1eMyxCSAnBOyptRIt","attribution":"www.outdoorgearlab.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.thesolarlab.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.thesolarlab.com/review/best-small-power-stations","title":"Best Small Power Stations for Emergencies & Off-Grid","snippet":"The Best Small Power Stations \u00b7 1. The Anker C300X Portable Power Station \u00b7 2. DJI Power 500 Portable Power Station \u00b7 3. DJI Power 1000 Power Station \u00b7 4. EcoFlow\u00a0...","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":2},"pub_date":null,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/AYlWzVR3Fglf2a_0V4d6-XZ9anblWLfawm2m85caHC8Aq9Q11DD2jKqTnJLqHwP9pHm8e-ESeEq2YXrPE8id9n7vkMtXcyVmvgcSU2P-sH8d3u2sRWHrLn8XuLBrfhFl4jcGDgjzMzq5zQ8Qzdip6Ev8GBQK49MCe70j3JifIn0fIzPlXE-1pqXv2c8Ll0VfafzSr23O5J5aEqmWkpQRug","attribution":"www.thesolarlab.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.outdoortechlab.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.outdoortechlab.com/best-portable-power-stations-under-500/","title":"Best Portable Power Stations Under $500 (2026 Field Tested)","snippet":"Jackery Explorer 1000 v2 \u2014 Best Overall Under $500. 1,070Wh LiFePO4 Battery | 1,500W Output | 23.8 lbs | Solar Ready. Rating: 4.6/5 stars |\u00a0...","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":3},"pub_date":1761514194.0,"attribution":"www.outdoortechlab.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.youtube.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NyjtUU0290w","title":"7 Portable Power Stations You MUST Stop Buying (And 3 ...","snippet":"Save your precious time, these are the 3 recommended to by: Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2, Bluetti AC200L, EcoFlow Delta 2 Max.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":4},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"www.youtube.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.popularmechanics.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.popularmechanics.com/home/tools/g69576197/ecoflow-cyber-monday-sale-2025/","title":"EcoFlow Cyber Monday Sale 2025: Save More Than 60% Off on These Editor-Favorite Power Stations","snippet":"EcoFlow\u2019s Cyber Monday 2025 sale offers discounts of more than 60% on nine editor-recommended portable power stations and backup power bundles, with prices ranging from $200 to $4,699. The deals cater to different needs, from charging personal devices during camping trips to providing backup electricity for entire homes.\n\nAffordable options include the Delta 3 1000 Air ($200), offering up to 800 watts in boost mode, and the River 3 with a 45-watt portable solar panel ($247), ideal for outdoor adventures. For greater power needs, the Delta 3 Max bundle ($699) includes a free Trail 200 DC power station.\n\nLarger systems offer substantial savings. The Delta Pro 3,600-watt station costs $1,329, a record 50% discount, and has powered a full-size refrigerator for over 51 hours in testing. The Delta Pro 3, 4,000-watt model costs $2,099, while bundles with an extra battery or 400-watt solar panel provide expanded capacity and off-grid charging.\n\nFor comprehensive home backup, the Delta Pro Ultra delivers 7,200 watts for $3,799. The Delta Pro Ultra bundle with Smart Home Panel 2 costs $4,699, saving $2,500 and enabling remote monitoring through a mobile app.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":16},"pub_date":1764586800.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/t1Dabkhp9cXC66lcVcrnRKvYHerasWF3wSEp_icPtx5OiZyG1eq8ZyfO1F1H5gpSm9a-o3XN4WKUJ3gypkDeRfzhaHS5CBjeGXAyIQNu1GS6LXdkl523A88qMp24iyPRQKAv_qQwjOE3_BWFuMawOVVEBL4evaosLT8yEOHVJnjS6TV3BXLzgsnzPCnUjDwnEnyWe_OxTteyFRuPMk2o8DiLQs2_ORNjJRSxbtiyxwM","attribution":"www.popularmechanics.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.goodhousekeeping.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/home-products/g70424851/top-tested-solar-powered-generators/","title":"8 Best Solar-Powered Generators for Storm Backup, According to Home Experts","snippet":"Good Housekeeping evaluates eight solar-powered generators for storm and outage backup, ranging from compact travel units to whole-house systems. The Jackery HomePower 3000 is the top mid-size choice, offering 3,072 watts, long battery retention, and enough output for major appliances. The EcoFlow RIVER 3 and Bluetti EB3A are lightweight, affordable options for phones, laptops, and small devices, while the Anker SOLIX F1500 and Goal Zero Yeti 500 balance portability with moderate emergency power. Generac\u2019s GB2000 emphasizes rugged outdoor use, though its battery has a shorter lifespan. For automatic home backup, the Anker Solix F3800 and EcoFlow Delta Pro Ultra can connect to electrical panels, power major appliances, and expand substantially with additional batteries; the Delta Pro Ultra is the most powerful but also the heaviest and most expensive. Testing covered capacity, charging, usability, and durability across laboratories and consumer homes. Buyers should consider wattage, runtime, solar-panel compatibility, battery chemistry, and portability. Solar generators are quieter, emissions-free, and safer indoors than gas models, though gas remains preferable for very high power demands.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":17},"pub_date":1772207940.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/8BQXwjZAjmZECnJm3owmsZEgshclc2WSO5uFAGpRNsFRcJg7PmdJUb9jNqCBon5SQ8mbjxcqAQezvFk93wsdxL1fvTzu30q5010owGc9pAZqrD9dGmSNwpW-XrCOBQCM5i2Ker4C7vqu17jKiCbHUTO0uDHLjJnuQ9XwEaChHaHSxuR3cmvMtR-uCLYBRHfFsiqGACoqQ29TAp4rMtYKRhohNAjReD5jRJ7lvmf604dBXBZQ9Va5QErgbkhVaykK","attribution":"www.goodhousekeeping.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"nypost.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nypost.com/2026/09/26/shopping/jackery-explorer-1000-v2-drops-below-500-at-amazon/","title":"Power out? This Jackery station can keep essentials running and it's under $500","snippet":"El art\u00edculo destaca la estaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda port\u00e1til Jackery Explorer 1000 v2, disponible por menos de 500 d\u00f3lares durante las ofertas anticipadas de Prime Big Deal Days de Amazon. Este precio representa su nivel m\u00e1s bajo en los \u00faltimos 30 d\u00edas y la convierte en una opci\u00f3n atractiva para emergencias el\u00e9ctricas, acampadas y actividades al aire libre.\n\nEl dispositivo ofrece una potencia de salida de 1.500 W y una potencia m\u00e1xima de 3.000 W, suficiente para alimentar electrodom\u00e9sticos esenciales, como refrigeradores, y cargar varios dispositivos simult\u00e1neamente. Incluye tres tomas de corriente alterna, dos puertos USB-C de 100 W, un puerto USB-A de 18 W y una toma de 12 V para autom\u00f3vil. Con un peso de aproximadamente 10,9 kg y un asa de transporte, resulta f\u00e1cil de trasladar.\n\nLa estaci\u00f3n puede recargarse en 1,7 horas mediante un enchufe convencional, en aproximadamente una hora con el modo de carga de emergencia o mediante energ\u00eda solar con una entrada de hasta 400 W. Tambi\u00e9n permite supervisar su funcionamiento mediante una aplicaci\u00f3n m\u00f3vil. Incluye una garant\u00eda de tres a\u00f1os, ampliable a cinco mediante registro en l\u00ednea, y una pol\u00edtica de devoluci\u00f3n de 30 d\u00edas.\n\nLas ofertas Prime Big Deal Days se celebrar\u00e1n del 6 al 7 de octubre de 2026 y estar\u00e1n disponibles exclusivamente para miembros de Amazon Prime.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":19},"pub_date":1790418600.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/NY8Yhy133XBrZE6icqAIQgLoO3fbXm-NjEWjmlVPiQ3Ex9-5ZBN5MAFb2jzFjpRqYrQHkT3VnS45rY7253nPXAyjmUcKNTgHD1pz0weOU9z67xwbh5Xl0OQh9vxPDTLxoxyKhaPI09EuAh_OolRfnuugcIVj_h_t1oYp2r8CJ-0","attribution":"nypost.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.automoblog.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.automoblog.com/reviews/products/best-portable-power-stations/","title":"Best Portable Power Stations for 2025 (Tested & Reviewed)","snippet":"The best portable power station in 2025 is the Goal Zero Yeti 1500X. Though it's large, the Yeti 1500X is reliably built, pairs well with solar\u00a0...","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":7},"pub_date":null,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/7PbzGzaR9OZbEyKox28Fk1O6RW2w8RtOMEYcAI7vlI1KawS0E7dObV4yM4flyjx0a4hHpAU4JdTGAOIy5364e3KrAt348BLrLHqFgYypSCR-HDLqQCgiMKxFF1w4y2zvNhXH47dS6XFtlwRSXK87s_4lyDPTAfHPPdJB1X_Tr6bwmlmZDLUIioUYia906-3E","attribution":"www.automoblog.com"}]}],"debug_sonic_thread_id":"thread_6ae8d9674f788327861fcbcfb7eb5035","hide_inline_actions":true,"disable_turn_actions":true,"cot_version":"v5","request_id":"acb0d2fd-c2f7-4cda-ab38-fd475a560c8f","message_type":"next","turn_exchange_id":"23dac912-e505-47d9-ac3c-aa4a8679a484","working_turn_id":"23dac912-e505-47d9-ac3c-aa4a8679a484","model_slug":"gpt-6","default_model_slug":"gpt-6","parent_id":"08fbd4bc-b450-417c-9a01-1a405a3a3355","reasoning_title_content_transition":"numeric","reasoning_titles":["Searching 14 websites"],"reasoning_title":"Searching 14 websites","reasoning_status":"is_reasoning","tool_icons":["https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.techradar.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.sfgate.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.digitalcameraworld.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nymag.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=backuppowerhub.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.outdoorgearlab.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.thesolarlab.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.outdoortechlab.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.youtube.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.popularmechanics.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?dom