nter-storms-and-its-usd119-off-at-best-buy","title":"This EcoFlow Delta 3 Classic bundle is the home backup battery I'd keep ready for winter storms, and it's $119 off at Best Buy","snippet":"EcoFlow\u2019s Delta 3 Classic bundle is on sale at Best Buy for $479, down $119 (20%) from its $598 list price. The 26.7-pound power station has a 1,024Wh lithium iron phosphate battery rated for 3,000 charge cycles, 1,800W continuous AC output (3,600W peak), and a five-year warranty. It can provide quiet, fume-free backup for essentials such as a refrigerator, router, space heater, or CPAP machine, and is also suited to camping and RV use. The bundle includes a protective bag and a 45W solar panel. However, the panel is too small for rapid recharging and would need more than a full day of ideal sunlight to refill the battery, so it is best treated as a top-up option. The article recommends the deal for dependable outage backup, while noting that the model itself has not been tested; the recommendation draws on EcoFlow\u2019s track record and tests of other products. Buyers should also consider its weight and that it is sold and shipped by a Best Buy marketplace seller.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":10},"pub_date":1793388756.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/KWkWz0pRGulOzSz30sD7vjOd-biDV-1NejwojYjvrSiujvn1QYn0NK4r0eD37w5loKjYaHv8N5hcjgnda41WAll2WXtjTqIoCaMvpBqDeaVI9FsJSOC5xyIjgqpl3O1V","attribution":"www.techradar.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techradar.com/best/portable-power-stations","title":"Best portable power stations: Reliable off-grid power & backup","snippet":"The EcoFlow Delta 3 Plus takes our top spot for most users, blending generous capacity and rapid recharge times with a wide selection of ports. \u00b7 \u00b7","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8},"pub_date":1657644279.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/NHjvoePjtEhiMNGF_wHQzeNP6yrSjlToqQMmT