larmechanics.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.popularmechanics.com/home/tools/g69576197/ecoflow-cyber-monday-sale-2025/","title":"EcoFlow Cyber Monday Sale 2025: Save More Than 60% Off on These Editor-Favorite Power Stations","snippet":"EcoFlow\u2019s Cyber Monday 2025 sale offers discounts of more than 60% on nine editor-recommended portable power stations and backup power bundles, with prices ranging from $200 to $4,699. The deals cater to different needs, from charging personal devices during camping trips to providing backup electricity for entire homes.\n\nAffordable options include the Delta 3 1000 Air ($200), offering up to 800 watts in boost mode, and the River 3 with a 45-watt portable solar panel ($247), ideal for outdoor adventures. For greater power needs, the Delta 3 Max bundle ($699) includes a free Trail 200 DC power station.\n\nLarger systems offer substantial savings. The Delta Pro 3,600-watt station costs $1,329, a record 50% discount, and has powered a full-size refrigerator for over 51 hours in testing. The Delta Pro 3, 4,000-watt model costs $2,099, while bundles with an extra battery or 400-watt solar panel provide expanded capacity and off-grid charging.\n\nFor comprehensive home backup, the Delta Pro Ultra delivers 7,200 watts for $3,799. The Delta Pro Ultra bundle with Smart Home Panel 2 costs $4,699, saving $2,500 and enabling remote monitoring through a mobile app.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":16},"pub_date":1764586800.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/t1Dabkhp9cXC66lcVcrnRKvYHerasWF3wSEp_icPtx5OiZyG1eq8ZyfO1F1H5gpSm9a-o3XN4WKUJ3gypkDeRfzhaHS5CBjeGXAyIQNu1GS6LXdkl523A88qMp24iyPRQKAv_qQwjOE3_BWFuMawOVVEBL4evaosLT8yEOHVJnjS6TV3BXLzgsnzPCnUjDwnEnyWe_OxTteyFRuPMk2o8DiLQs2_ORNjJRSxbtiyxwM","attribution":"www.popularmechanics.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.goodhousekeeping.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/home-products/g70424851/top-tested-solar-powered-generators/","title":"8 Best Solar-Powered Generators for Storm Backup, According to Home Experts","snippet":"Good Housekeeping evaluates eight solar-powered generators for storm and outage backup, ranging from compact travel units to whole-house systems. The Jackery HomePower 3000 is the top mid-size choice, offering 3,072 watts, long battery retention, and enough output for major appliances. The EcoFlow RIVER 3 and Bluetti EB3A are lightweight, affordable options for phones, laptops, and small devices, while the Anker SOLIX F1500 and Goal Zero Yeti 500 balance portability with moderate emergency power. Generac\u2019s GB2000 emphasizes rugged outdoor use, though its battery has a shorter lifespan. For automatic home backup, the Anker Solix F3800 and EcoFlow Delta Pro Ultra can connect to electrical panels, power major appliances, and expand substantially with additional batteries; the Delta Pro Ultra is the most powerful but also the heaviest and most expensive. Testing covered capacity, charging, usability, and durability across laboratories and consumer homes. Buyers should consider wattage, runtime, solar-panel compatibility, battery chemistry, and portability. Solar generators are quieter, emissions-free, and safer indoors than gas models, though gas remains preferable for very high power demands.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":17},"pub_date":1772207940.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/8BQXwjZAjmZECnJm3owmsZEgshclc2WSO5uFAGpRNsFRcJg7PmdJUb9jNqCBon5SQ8mbjxcqAQezvFk93wsdxL1fvTzu30q5010owGc9pAZqrD9dGmSNwpW-XrCOBQCM5i2Ker4C7vqu17jKiCbHUTO0uDHLjJnuQ9XwEaChHaHSxuR3cmvMtR-uCLYBRHfFsiqGACoqQ29TAp4rMtYKRhohNAjReD5jRJ7lvmf604dBXBZQ9Va5QErgbkhVaykK","attribution":"www.goodhousekeeping.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"nypost.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nypost.com/2026/09/26/shopping/jackery-explorer-1000-v2-drops-below-500-at-amazon/","title":"Power out? This Jackery station can keep essentials running and it's under $500","snippet":"El art\u00edculo destaca la estaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda port\u00e1til Jackery Explorer 1000 v2, disponible por menos de 500 d\u00f3lares durante las ofertas anticipadas de Prime Big Deal Days de Amazon. Este precio representa su nivel m\u00e1s bajo en los \u00faltimos 30 d\u00edas y la convierte en una opci\u00f3n atractiva para emergencias el\u00e9ctricas, acampadas y actividades al aire libre.\n\nEl dispositivo ofrece una potencia de salida de 1.500 W y una potencia m\u00e1xima de 3.000 W, suficiente para alimentar electrodom\u00e9sticos esenciales, como refrigeradores, y cargar varios dispositivos simult\u00e1neamente. Incluye tres tomas de corriente alterna, dos puertos USB-C de 100 W, un puerto USB-A de 18 W y una toma de 12 V para autom\u00f3vil. Con un peso de aproximadamente 10,9 kg y un asa de transporte, resulta f\u00e1cil de trasladar.\n\nLa estaci\u00f3n puede recargarse en 1,7 horas mediante un enchufe convencional, en aproximadamente una hora con el modo de carga de emergencia o mediante energ\u00eda solar con una entrada de hasta 400 W. Tambi\u00e9n permite supervisar su funcionamiento mediante una aplicaci\u00f3n m\u00f3vil. Incluye una garant\u00eda de tres a\u00f1os, ampliable a cinco mediante registro en l\u00ednea, y una pol\u00edtica de devoluci\u00f3n de 30 d\u00edas.\n\nLas ofertas Prime Big Deal Days se celebrar\u00e1n del 6 al 7 de octubre de 2026 y estar\u00e1n disponibles exclusivamente para miembros de Amazon Prime.","ref_id":{"turn_index":951235,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":19},"pub_date":1790418600.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/NY8Yhy133XBrZE6icqAIQgLoO3fbXm-NjEWjmlVPiQ3Ex9-5ZBN5MAFb2jzFjpRqYrQHkT3VnS45rY7253nPXAyjmUcKNTgHD1pz0weOU9z67xwbh5Xl0OQh9vxPDTLxoxyKhaPI09EuAh_OolRfnuugcIVj_h_t1oYp2r8CJ-0","attribution":"nypost.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.automoblog.com","entrie